==English==

===Etymology===
Possibly from ''[[wiseacre]]'' though unlikely as it is not an expression the British have heard of.

Reportedly a middle-eastern word referring to the genitalia of a female camel, however, northern english sources place it as meaning either a bull's penis or a donkey's foreskin.

